Vectrex System ROM (core/vectrex_bios.h)

The 8 KB System ROM of the GCE Vectrex (1982, with the built-in game Mine
Storm) is (c) General Consumer Electronics / Milton Bradley. Smith
Engineering, which held the rights to the Vectrex, gave permission on
27 October 1992 for the original Vectrex ROMs, manuals and other original
material to be copied and distributed freely for non-commercial purposes.
This is a permission, not a release into the public domain; the copyright
stays with its owner.

The ROM is built in here as the widely used emulator vecx (libretro) builds
it in, from the same data (MD5 ab082fa8c8e632dd68589a8c7741388f). It is not
covered by this project's licence. Should the rights holder object, it is
removed.

Only for non-commercial use.
